  setup filter area in base_list.js creates error on custom reports in erpnext due to missing argument
## Description of the issue
following lines in base_list.js create an error on certain lists created in ERPNext
```
	setup_filter_area() {
		this.filter_area = new FilterArea(this);

		if (this.filters.length > 0) {
			return this.filter_area.set(this.filters);
		}
	}
```
